### Basic Flutter Map Widget Implementation (Dart)

Source: https://context7.com/fleaflet/flutter_map/llms.txt

This snippet demonstrates the basic setup of the FlutterMap widget, including setting initial center coordinates, zoom levels, and a tile layer for displaying map tiles. It requires the flutter_map and latlong2 packages.

```dart
import 'package:flutter/material.dart';
import 'package:flutter_map/flutter_map.dart';
import 'package:latlong2/latlong.dart';

class BasicMapExample extends StatelessWidget {
  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    return Scaffold(
      body: FlutterMap(
        options: MapOptions(
          initialCenter: LatLng(51.5, -0.09),
          initialZoom: 13.0,
          minZoom: 3.0,
          maxZoom: 18.0,
          backgroundColor: Color(0xFFE0E0E0),
        ),
        children: [
          TileLayer(
            urlTemplate: 'https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png',
            userAgentPackageName: 'com.example.app',
          ),
        ],
      ),
    );
  }
}
```

--------------------------------

### Programmatic Map Control with MapController (Dart)

Source: https://context7.com/fleaflet/flutter_map/llms.txt

This example shows how to use the MapController to programmatically control map features like moving to specific locations and rotating the map. It utilizes a StatefulWidget to manage the MapController and includes buttons to trigger these actions. Dependencies: flutter_map, latlong2.

```dart
import 'package:flutter/material.dart';
import 'package:flutter_map/flutter_map.dart';
import 'package:latlong2/latlong.dart';

class MapControllerExample extends StatefulWidget {
  @override
  State<MapControllerExample> createState() => _MapControllerExampleState();
}

class _MapControllerExampleState extends State<MapControllerExample> {
  final MapController _mapController = MapController();

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    return Scaffold(
      body: Column(
        children: [
          Row(
            children: [
              ElevatedButton(
                onPressed: () => _mapController.move(LatLng(51.5, -0.09), 18),
                child: Text('London'),
              ),
              ElevatedButton(
                onPressed: () => _mapController.move(LatLng(48.8566, 2.3522), 15),
                child: Text('Paris'),
              ),
              ElevatedButton(
                onPressed: () => _mapController.rotate(45.0),
                child: Text('Rotate 45°'),
              ),
            ],
          ),
          Expanded(
            child: FlutterMap(
              mapController: _mapController,
              options: MapOptions(
                initialCenter: LatLng(51.5, -0.09),
                initialZoom: 5.0,
              ),
              children: [
                TileLayer(
                  urlTemplate: 'https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png',
                  userAgentPackageName: 'com.example.app',
                ),
              ],
            ),
          ),
        ],
      ),
    );
  }
}
```

